<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="mb-8">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700 shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.879 7.519c1.171-1.025 3.071-1.025 4.242 0 1.172 1.025 1.172 2.687 0 3.712-.203.179-.43.326-.67.442-.745.361-1.45.999-1.45 1.827v.75M12 17.25h.008v.008H12v-.008zM21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900 leading-tight">技术支持</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">最近更新：<%= updatedDate %></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-4">感谢您使用 <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900"><%= siteName %></strong>。下面的常见问题多数能即时帮您解决；仍未解决可按问题类型选择对应联系渠道。</p>
  </div>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">常见问题</h2>
  <div class="space-y-2.5 mb-10">

    <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition open:border-slate-300 open:shadow-sm">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 cursor-pointer select-none list-none font-medium text-slate-800 group-hover:text-brand-700">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true">🔑</span> 登录不上 / 忘记密码</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.17l3.71-3.94a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>登录页底部点「忘记密码」，按邮箱里的链接重置即可。</li>
          <li>启用了二次验证 (MFA) 但找不到认证器：用注册 MFA 时下载的备用码登录后，立刻关闭再重新启用。</li>
          <li>邮件没收到：先查垃圾邮件夹；仍无果请联系站点运营者重置邮件。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition open:border-slate-300 open:shadow-sm">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 cursor-pointer select-none list-none font-medium text-slate-800 group-hover:text-brand-700">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true">📱</span> APP 扫码登录失败 / 一直转圈</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.17l3.71-3.94a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>确认手机能正常打开 <code class="text-[0.85em] bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded"><%= siteName %></code> 的网页（即手机能联通服务器）。</li>
          <li>「设置 → 我的设备 → 绑定新设备」生成新的二维码再试（旧码 10 分钟过期）。</li>
          <li>启用了 MFA 的账号需走「扫码登录」流程，不能用「邮箱密码」快速登录。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition open:border-slate-300 open:shadow-sm">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 cursor-pointer select-none list-none font-medium text-slate-800 group-hover:text-brand-700">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true">🔄</span> 事件不同步 / 周视图缺事件</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.17l3.71-3.94a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>在 APP 日历列表往下拉，触发一次下拉刷新。</li>
          <li>退出 APP 重新进入；前台启动时会自动重新拉取最新事件。</li>
          <li>确认事件所在的日历没有被「设置 → 筛选日历」隐藏。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition open:border-slate-300 open:shadow-sm">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 cursor-pointer select-none list-none font-medium text-slate-800 group-hover:text-brand-700">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true">👥</span> 如何邀请别人参加事件</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.17l3.71-3.94a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>网页 / iOS：编辑事件 →「管理参与者」→ 输入对方邮箱 → 发送（iOS 仅在已保存的事件上可用）。</li>
          <li>对方会收到带 .ics 附件的邀请邮件，回复 RSVP 后您可在事件详情看到接受/拒绝状态。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition open:border-slate-300 open:shadow-sm">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 cursor-pointer select-none list-none font-medium text-slate-800 group-hover:text-brand-700">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true">📅</span> 在 Apple Calendar / Outlook 里订阅</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.17l3.71-3.94a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>只读订阅：网页打开日历右键菜单 →「订阅链接」生成 ICS 地址 → 在 Apple Calendar「文件 → 新建日历订阅」粘贴。</li>
          <li>双向同步：请用 CalDAV，用户名/密码在「设置 → 应用密码」生成专用密码。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition open:border-slate-300 open:shadow-sm">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 cursor-pointer select-none list-none font-medium text-slate-800 group-hover:text-brand-700">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true">🗑️</span> 注销账号 / 删除所有数据</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.17l3.71-3.94a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>网页或 APP：设置 → 账号 → 危险区 →「删除账户」。<strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900">此操作不可恢复</strong>，会清空您所有日历、事件、邀请、设备绑定。</li>
          <li>如需先备份再删除，可在删除前导出 .ics 文件保存到本地。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>

  </div>

  <!-- Contact channels -->
  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">仍然没解决？</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">按问题类型选择对应入口，最快拿到答案。</p>

  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-8">
    <!-- Operator -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 flex flex-col">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 mb-3" aria-hidden="true">👤</span>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">账号 / 数据 / 服务器</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">账号被锁、数据恢复、维护时间等。数据都在<strong class="font-medium text-slate-700">本站运营者</strong>的服务器上，请联系运营者（联系方式见页脚）。</p>
    </div>
    <!-- GitHub -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 flex flex-col">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white mb-3">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .5C5.73.5.5 5.74.5 12.02c0 5.08 3.29 9.39 7.86 10.91.58.1.79-.25.79-.56 0-.27-.01-1.16-.02-2.1-3.2.7-3.88-1.36-3.88-1.36-.52-1.33-1.28-1.69-1.28-1.69-1.05-.72.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.2 1.77 1.2 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.56-.29-5.26-1.28-5.26-5.71 0-1.26.45-2.29 1.19-3.1-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.18 1.18a11.1 11.1 0 015.8 0c2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.81 1.19 1.84 1.19 3.1 0 4.44-2.7 5.42-5.27 5.7.41.36.78 1.07.78 2.16 0 1.56-.01 2.82-.01 3.2 0 .31.21.67.8.56A11.53 11.53 0 0023.5 12.02C23.5 5.74 18.27.5 12 .5z"/></svg>
      </span>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">APP / 软件 bug</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">前端 / APP / 服务端的 bug、功能建议、开源协作。</p>
      <div class="mt-auto flex flex-col gap-1 text-xs">
        <a href="https://github.com/wuha-like-sleep/by-wave-calendar/issues" class="text-brand-700 hover:underline font-medium">提交 Issue ↗</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/wuha-like-sleep/by-wave-calendar/discussions" class="text-brand-700 hover:underline">Discussions ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Email -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 flex flex-col">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-brand-50 text-brand-700 mb-3" aria-hidden="true">✉️</span>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">商务 / 媒体 / 通用</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">企业部署咨询、合作、通用询问。</p>
      <a href="mailto:info@by-wave.com" class="mt-auto text-xs text-brand-700 hover:underline font-mono break-all">info@by-wave.com</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Response times -->
  <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4">
    <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2.5 flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">⏱️</span> 响应时间预期</h3>
    <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-1.5">
      <li><strong class="font-medium text-slate-800">GitHub Issues</strong> —— 一般 1–7 天内回复；紧急安全问题请同时发邮件。</li>
      <li><strong class="font-medium text-slate-800">邮件</strong> —— 1–3 个工作日（邮件标题注明类型，如「[Bug] iOS 周视图…」「[商务] 企业部署」更快分类）。</li>
      <li><strong class="font-medium text-slate-800">本站账号问题</strong> —— 取决于站点运营者，通常会在首页 / 登录页给出预期响应时间。</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-3">本服务是开源 + 自托管项目，由志愿者维护，没有 7×24 客服，敬请理解。</p>
  </div>

</div>
